e will be captured in different light intensities and pose. These images are stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":287985,"global_rank":28029,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5741},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":287971,"global_rank":28044,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5742},{"name":"renysaldivar/Charms","owner":"renysaldivar","html_url":"https://github.com/renysaldivar/Charms","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":287961,"global_rank":28046,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5743},{"name":"kevingoldsmith/fitbit-extract","owner":"kevingoldsmith","html_url":"https://github.com/kevingoldsmith/fitbit-extract","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":16,"language":"Python","description":"extract my data from the fitbit API","topics":[],"score":287940,"global_rank":28057,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5744},{"name":"lephubui/command-code","owner":"lephubui","html_url":"https://github.com/lephubui/command-code","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":3,"language":"Python","description":"Command & Code playground","topics":[],"score":287936,"global_rank":28061,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5745},{"name":"jiadong324/SVisionUtils","owner":"jiadong324","html_url":"https://github.com/jiadong